Song Title: Yes He Lives
Artist / Author:
Writers: Alexander Pappas, Ben Fielding, Hannah Hobbs, Tahisha Hunt
Release year:
CCLI song #: 7194351
Order: Verse 2, Chorus, Bridge, Bridge, Bridge, Chorus, Bridge, Bridge, Verse 1

Verse 2
There in the silence, it wasn’t over
Oh our Redeemer was getting ready to rise
And on that morning they came to find Him
That tomb was empty ’cause He is alive
That tomb was empty ’cause He is alive

Chorus
He lives, He’s risen from the grave
Victorious, our Saviour reigns, oh yes, He reigns
He rose, the stone is rolled away
Forever our Redeemer lives, oh yes, He lives

Bridge
Jesus Christ crucified
Through His death there is life
By the blood of the Lamb
We have been forgiven
Our debt has been paid
There is grace upon grace
Only one name that saves
And His name is Jesus

